		[61366] = { -- The Voidspire
			{ "The Voidspire · S1 (Mar 17, 2026) · Voidstorm · 6 · 246 to 256", 2405, 45.05, 64.71 },
			"Order: Imperator Averzian → then you choose Vorasius or Fallen-King Salhadaar (on Normal and higher) → Vaelgor & Ezzorak → Lightblinded Vanguard → Crown of the Cosmos (final boss).",
			"Raid Finder wings: 1 Void weapons (Averzian, Vorasius, Salhadaar) · 2 Light zealots (Vaelgor & Ezzorak, Vanguard) · 3 Crown of the Cosmos. Story mode only has the Crown.",
			"The Only Winning Move Is Not To Play: Imperator Averzian",
			"Clear the enemies before the boss: 3 banners appear in front of the arena. Three different players pick one up each. If someone picks one up by mistake, reset the boss so they appear again.",
			"The floor is a tic-tac-toe grid (three in a row). After the adds' absorptions you can place a banner on a square.",
			"Put all 3 in a line (horizontal, vertical or diagonal) and let the boss's collapse destroy them. When the achievement turns white, kill the boss.",
			"(unconfirmed) Not every report agrees: one says \"beat the boss to the cat\" and another \"make its collapse destroy all 3\". The official description says \"after making it destroy your banners\".",
			"Hungry Hungry Hatchlings: Vorasius",
			"At the start, everyone except one tank grabs a whelp from the nest or barrel to the right of the arena.",
			"A white beam appears above your hatchling; you only see your own.",
			"Kill the Blistercreep adds near the boss; they drop meat and your hatchling eats it. Each hatchling needs 8 corpses to fall asleep.",
			"When all the hatchlings are asleep, kill Vorasius.",
			"It's Treason Then: Fallen-King Salhadaar",
			"Before starting, everyone types /kneel in front of the king. It gives you a debuff.",
			"During the fight, shadows of yourself appear: you have to face your shadow or you die instantly.",
			"The achievement counts even if there are dead players at the end.",
			"Note: don't try it with a progression group: the Broken Oath kills you about 10 seconds after the pull if you fail.",
			"Ready, Set, Snap!: Vaelgor & Ezzorak",
			"When Vaelgor casts the null beam, the whole raid gets inside (the circle shrinks).",
			"Then a sphere appears that roots everyone (Nullzone). Everyone breaks the root in under 3 seconds using movement abilities. A single miss ruins the attempt.",
			"The achievement indicator turns from red to white on each phase done right.",
			"Breaking the root damages the whole raid: you need good healing. Stampeding Roar (druid) and Wind Rush Totem (shaman) help. With more gear the fight is shorter and has fewer phases.",
			"Aura Farming: Lightblinded Vanguard",
			"Before the arena, each player clicks the little book on the right: it gives the achievement debuff.",
			"The boss creates 3 auras; everyone has to stand in each one until reaching Maximum Aura.",
			"If your aura is higher than another player's, you stun them until it evens out: leave a clear path for each aura.",
			"Kill the boss when the whole raid has Maximum Aura.",
			"We Will, In Fact, See It Again: Crown of the Cosmos",
			"Before the final boss, stand in a small puddle next to the teleport orb until you have 10 stacks. You get a piece of meat with an extra action button (throwing it costs health).",
			"Kill the first 3 minibosses. Alleria throws them into the center.",
			"Everyone throws their meat at the Voidness; if one is missing, it doesn't progress.",
			"The Fleshy Monstrosity appears: kill it fast, because it converts players and makes you damage the ones near you.",
			"You have to throw meat again in the second intermission. Then kill the Crown.",
			"Comments: it can be done with fewer than 10 people.",
			"Nothing to See Here: any fight",
			"Let the Devouring Host consume you: leave the map or jump off an edge (the easiest is Vorasius' platform). It works in Voidspire or in March on Quel'Danas, Raid Finder too. It is individual.",
		},
		[61367] = { -- March on Quel'Danas
			{ "March on Quel'Danas · S1 (Mar 31, 2026) · Isle of Quel'Danas, over the bridge from Silvermoon · 2 · 256", 2424, 52.61, 85.75 },
			"Bosses: Belo'ren, Child of Al'ar → Midnight Falls (with L'ura). Raid Finder: a single wing (since Apr 7, 2026). Story mode only has the last boss.",
			"Eggsistential Crisis: Belo'ren",
			"A tank takes the egg from the Sunwell; a bar appears.",
			"Fill the whole bar with Light.",
			"Then fill it completely with Void. Changing color resets the progress: finish one color before moving to the other.",
			"Kill Belo'ren.",
			"All the Things She Said: Midnight Falls",
			"Before starting, interact with the Void torch on the right side of the room, facing the boss.",
			"During the fight, memories of Alleria appear. Don't kill them: bring them back to L'ura. You need 12.",
			"In phase 3, according to one report, you have to kick the adds from the Void portion 12 times before they disappear (unconfirmed).",
			"Kill the boss.",
		},
