		[61568] = { -- Glory of the Midnight Hero
			"It's in the general Dungeons category, not the Midnight one.",
			"Mythic 0 is enough; you don't need a keystone. Use the premade group finder and list yourself as tank or healer: they are in high demand.",
			"To practice the role, do them on Heroic first (it doesn't count, but you learn the route).",
			"Note: Windrunner Spire, Maisara Caverns, Magisters' Terrace and Nexus-Point Xenas are not in season 2, and the rotation applies to Heroic and Mythic. Until they come back, those 4 can't be done on Mythic, so the healer and tank achievements can't be finished this season. (unconfirmed) Check it in the group finder: if it lets you pick their Mythic, it can be done.",
		},
		[61574] = { -- Legends Never Die
			"Decor",
			"Learn the story of the 7 relics of the Legends of the Haranir world event (a short scenario each week; you pick the relic).",
			"The first 5 (Wey'nan's Ward, The Cauldron of Echoes, The Echoless Flame, Russula's Outreach, Aln'hara's Bloom) can be done in one week with 5 characters.",
			"The last 2 (Root of the World and Sky's Hope) only unlock when the same character has the first 5.",
			"Total: at least 7 weeks.",
			"Tip: always use the same main character so the last 2 unlock as soon as possible.",
			"Decor: \"Call of On'ohia\"",
			"The 7 relics of the weekly event Legends of the Haranir (Harandar): Wey'nan's Ward · The Cauldron of Echoes · Aln'hara's Bloom · The Echoless Flame · Russula's Outreach · Root of the World · Sky's Hope. The last 2 only open when the same character has the first 5: at least 7 weeks. Details and lore objects under Harandar.",
