			{ "It goes to its nest. When you get there, you get the achievement.", 2405, 43.96, 51.13 },
			"Player notes: there is also another critter that triggers it near the portal you arrive through the first time in Voidstorm. One player says the ripper didn't show up on a new character and suspects you need to progress the Voidstorm campaign; it's recommended to do it on your main character.",
		},
