		[62606] = { -- The Sunstrider Omnium
			"The Omnium folio is obtained from Grand Magister Rommath (Isle of Quel'Danas). Its 5 nodes open one per week (unconfirmed).",
			"New folio runes (12.1.7). They don't give an achievement, but they're part of the folio.",
			"Empowerment rune: +20% to the stat you choose.",
			"Critical Mass rune: more damage or healing from your main rune.",
			"When the patch starts, a Magister's Missive appears in the upper Bazaar of Silvermoon. It sends you to Umbric and Rommath at Magisters' Terrace.",
			"Rommath gives you In Search of Wisdom: Archive Logic. Finish the 12.1.7 campaign to get the quest that activates the first rune.",
			"Afterwards, do high-level content (world quests, raids, dungeons or battlegrounds) until you get the second Omnium Research Mote, which activates the second rune.",
			"Tip: the folio works like talents and you can move the points whenever you want. If you want the +20% from the start, turn off the bottom rune.",
		},
