		[62622] = { -- Ritual Renown
			"1 Regeneration orbs · 2 Ritual treasures · 3 Decor (Rae'ana) · 4 Outer hazards (rares) and stronger orbs · 5 Shrines of power and more loot · 6 Pets (Sergeant Vornin) · 7 Revered treasures and obelisk decor · 8 Mount (Vornin) and elite hazards.",
			"It goes up with Ritual Site Reports, Tablet Fragments and Tablets.",
			"Mounts with Marl (Sergeant Vornin): Unbound Mana Vermis (6000), Void-Touched Hawkstrider (4500).",
			"Mounts inside the site: Corrupted Eagle Talon (Broken Throne: carry the lost candle 51.5 47.8 to the circle 50.6 47.3), Corrupted Amani War Bear (Broken Throne: 5 Almost Pork on the meat piles 55.8 38.8 and the Chubs pet), Void-Touched Sea Dragon (Daggerspine Point: stranded seaweed).",
