		[63432] = { -- Mysterious Mix Master
			"Decor: Mysterious Voodoo Mask",
			"Get all 10 offerings out of Ofi's cauldron.",
			"How to unlock it: the quest Mixing Mysteries with Ofi the Cunning, next to her cauldron at Tokka's Landing. You need level 90, rank 3 with the Zul'jarra forces and the previous quests What Lies Beyond the Fog → Esoteric Ingredients.",
			"How it works: Ofi asks you for 3 ingredients, one at a time in the dialogue. Depending on which ones you give, a different offering comes out. She tells you nothing while you choose, so follow the table.",
			"Wrathful: 3",
			"Virulent: 1 · 2",
			"Volatile: 1 · 2",
			"Apathetic: 3",
			"Hateful: 2 · 1",
			"Pestilent: 1 · 2",
			"Melancholic: 3",
			"Fragile: 2 · 1",
			"Creepy: 2 · 1",
			"Balanced: 1 · 1 · 1",
			"In total you need 10 of each ingredient.",
			"Where the ingredients come from (island treasures, with the warband reward Spoils of Coils; they can also be bought at the Auction House):",
			"Ancient Knucklebone: Cracked Canopic Jar.",
			"Serpent Feather: Venom-Clotted Bead.",
			"Murky Blood Pearl: Singing Shell.",
			"How often: reports don't agree. At launch it was daily and warband-wide (one try a day). Blizzard removed the wait and now it can be repeated, so with 30 ingredients you could do all 10 in one visit. (unconfirmed) Confirm it in game.",
		},
