		[63630] = { -- Assault the Vault
			{ "Reward: Venomous Coiler mount. Entrance to the vaults: (Western Fang).", 2509, 31.1, 64.94 },
			"How the rotation works: the temple Patrols (star) rotate every 10 minutes; talk to the NPC for an extra objective. Completing a Temple Assault (serpent head) opens an Incursion (10 minutes); winning the incursion brings out the Ancestral Rivals.",
			"Broken Bonds · Slay the Restless · Slay Children of Ula'tek · Siphon Venom · Scavenged Weapons · Breath and Bile · Congealed Venom · Dragged Below · Vengeance for the Dead · Ash to Ash · Calming the Dead · Laid to Rest.",
