			{ "Feather of Tok'jara: Spiritual Magnifier · Ledge of the Seal of Wrath, near the entrance to the Venomous Abyss", 2509, 48.46, 25.8 },
			"Mummified Lynx Paw: Corroded Key · Venom-Worn Chest, 5 possible spots: 52.51 53.85 · 41.96 53.58 · 42.51 12.01 · 47.48 37.59 · 53.69 18.18 (#2509)",
